**CHAR32
TOP + S1 S2 S3
S1 * IE1 A B
S2 * IE2 FLAG-ON C
S3 * IE3 FLAG-OFF D
ENDTREE
PROCESS TOP
IMPORT
  1.000000E-01 IE1 I
  2.000000E-01 IE2 I
  1.000000E+00 IE3 I
  3.000000E-01 A
  4.000000E-01 B
  5.000000E-01 C
  6.000000E-01 D
  1.000000E+00 FLAG-ON
  0.000000E+00 FLAG-OFF
  2.000000E-01 A
LIMIT 1.000000E-12
**FTITLE: IMPORT tags, values 0 and 1, duplicated import
*XEQ
